@startuml
title Visa Processing and Follow Up System State Diagram

[*] --> AccountCreationState

state AccountCreationState
state LoginState
state ApplicationFormState
state PaymentState
state AcceptanceState
state StatusViewState
state StatusCheckState
state CancellationState
state ModificationState
state DetailViewState
state PurposeViewState
state FeedbackState
state LogoutState

AccountCreationState --> LoginState : CreateAccountEvent
LoginState --> ApplicationFormState : LoginEvent
ApplicationFormState --> PaymentState : FillOutApplicationFormEvent
PaymentState --> AcceptanceState : PaymentEvent
AcceptanceState --> StatusViewState : AcceptanceEvent
StatusViewState --> StatusCheckState : CheckStatusEvent
StatusViewState --> CancellationState : CancelApplicationEvent
StatusViewState --> ModificationState : ModifyDetailsEvent
StatusCheckState --> FeedbackState : GiveFeedbackEvent
StatusCheckState --> LogoutState : LogoutEvent
CancellationState --> [*] : CancelledApplicationEvent
ModificationState --> DetailViewState : ViewDetailsEvent
DetailViewState --> PurposeViewState : ViewPurposeEvent
LogoutState --> [*] : LogoutEvent
@enduml
